OL,3,GNEWSATip closed after suspected
OL,4,Aexplosive found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling centre has closed after a
OL,7,Fsuspected explosive device was found,
OL,8,Fpolice said.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police was called to
OL,11,FHighbridge recycling centre, in
OL,12,FSomerset, at around 10:20 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday following reports of suspected
OL,14,Fordnance.
OL,16,F"An army explosive ordnance disposal
OL,17,Funit has been contacted and is on
OL,18,Froute," police said.
OL,20,FThe force said officers are on the
OL,21,Fscene and the site has been closed "as
OL,22,Fa precaution."
